output:  MON1-tiny-flasher.s19
0001                         *----------------------------------------------------------
0002                         * Tiny flasher code for MON1 board of Newbear 77-68
0003                         * from MON1 board manual
0004                         *
0005                         * Modified to use $F0FF for display LEDs
0006                         *
0007 f0ff                    DISPLAY EQU     $F0FF
0008                         
0009 ff00                            ORG     $FF00   * Start address in RAM
0010                         *
0011 ff00 08                 START   INX
0012 ff01 26 fd                      BNE     START
0013 ff03 4c                         INCA
0014 ff04 b7 f0 ff                   STAA    DISPLAY
0015 ff07 20 f7                      BRA     START
0016                         
0017 fffe                            ORG     $FFFE   * Address of RESET vector
0018 fffe ff 00                      FDB     #START  * Put start address in RESET vector
0019                         *
0020                         *       The end
0021                         *----------------------------------------------------------
